  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the Pork Belly into slice
  - Chop the Garlic into slice
  - Turn on the Stove to high heat
  - Put the Pan in the Stove
  - Add 1 tbsp of cooking oil
  - Add the chop Garlick
  - Add 1/2 of tbsp of Peppercorn
  - "Saut\xE9 the Garlick and peppercorn using Spatula Until brown"
  - Add the Chop Pork
  - Saute it until brown
  - Add 1/2 Cup of Vinegar
  - Add 1/4 Cup of Soy
  - Add 1 cup of water
  - Reduce the stove to low
  - Put the Pan Lid and simmer
